   "heading": "TURAEV-VIRO INVARIANTS AS AN EXTENDED TQFT Introduction Turaev–Viro (TV) invariants of 3-manifolds Z T V ( M ) were deﬁned by Turaev and Viro in [TV1992] using a quantum analog of 6j symbols for sl 2 . In the same paper it was shown that these invariants can be extended to a 3-dimensional TQFT. Late",
